{"id":"wb-8-310","name":"歙县太平桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"太平桥 (歙县)","text":"歙县太平桥又名河西桥，民间俗称寡妇桥、人皮桥，是位于中国安徽省黄山市歙县徽城镇城西练江上的一座纵列式法券大型联拱石拱桥，长268米，宽7.1米，高9.5米，十六孔，孔径12.4-16米不等，为安徽省最大的古石桥，有“千里江南第一桥”之誉。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E5%B9%B3%E6%A1%A5_(%E6%AD%99%E5%8E%BF)","revisionId":91722423,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91722423","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8fff015a21ff2b983976368e.jpg","title":"Taipingqiao_5294.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Taipingqiao_5294.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/Taipingqiao_5294.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Doctoroftcm","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​太平桥，安徽省文物保护单位，位于歙县。","width":320,"height":213}}